   50: push_constant_string "You seek the grail of old,"
   51: push_constant_string "<br>"
   52: push_constant_string "but no longer is it a goblet of gold."
   53: push_constant_string "<br>"
   54: push_constant_string "Among these nine will you find what you seek,"
   55: push_constant_string "<br>"
   56: push_constant_string "but be careful and don't peek!"
   57: push_constant_string "<br>"
   58: push_constant_string "A wrong choice will expel you,"
   59: push_constant_string "<br>"
   60: push_constant_string "so consider carefully each clue."
   61: push_constant_string "<br>"
   62: push_constant_string "<br>"
   63: push_constant_string "Three boxes contain only air,"
   64: push_constant_string "<br>"
   65: push_constant_string "beware of three boxes, for danger lurks there."
   66: push_constant_string "<br>"
   67: push_constant_string "Two hold only rubbish but would fool you with disguise,"
   68: push_constant_string "<br>"
   69: push_constant_string "only one box holds your prize."
   70: push_constant_string "<br>"
   71: push_constant_string "<br>"
   72: push_constant_string "Clues will give the information you need,"
   73: push_constant_string "<br>"
   74: push_constant_string "<br>"
   75: push_constant_string "rubbish always sits to the right of danger, pay heed."
   76: push_constant_string "<br>"
   77: push_constant_string "There is nothing helpful in boxes great in height,"
   78: push_constant_string "<br>"
   79: push_constant_string "and boxes on either end will not end your plight."
